    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of staring at a static screen? inScreen Dream Keyboard brings a dynamic and interactive 3D keyboard to your desktop that responds to your real-life typing, making every keystroke a delightful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Typing Sync:                    A beautiful 3D keyboard on your screen perfectly mimics your physical keystrokes in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works in the Background:      Enjoy the animations while using any other application, be it for work or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Unique Keycaps:           Swap your keycaps with a massive collection of creative and fun designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful Interactions:               Experience satisfying animations! Type on a sheep keycap and watch it jiggle, or press a corn keycap to see it pop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Customization:              Freely adjust camera angles, change keyboard cases, and set the perfect lighting to create your ideal virtual keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download inScreen Dream Keyboard today and make your desktop truly yours!</p>",
